      "writtenOn": "2020-12-01T04:42:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sounds like a good plan for this CL.  \n\nLonger-term we\u0027ll finish that TODO to evaluate whether we can supply the FRS current, and we\u0027ll most likely have a module in the DPM evaluating our ability to enable FRS based on our current source-out load",
      "parentUuid": "5f5070eb_ce71c645",
